WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.363
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.633 --> 00:30.051
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

3
00:31.427 --> 00:32.929
Do you know Bo-bae?

4
00:33.012 --> 00:34.347
Of course I do.

5
00:34.430 --> 00:35.515
I am

6
00:36.182 --> 00:37.851
a huge fan

7
00:38.518 --> 00:39.936
of Ms. Na Bo-bae, you see.

8
00:46.192 --> 00:47.026
Ms. Na.

9
00:48.403 --> 00:50.071
What brings you here?

10
00:50.155 --> 00:51.364
Hello, sir.

11
00:51.447 --> 00:52.365
Yeah.

12
00:55.994 --> 00:57.370
Oh!

13
00:58.204 --> 01:01.332
You said you were working on a new project with Director Yeom.

14
01:01.916 --> 01:05.253
That's the drama Mr. Baek's been talking to you about sponsoring?

15
01:05.336 --> 01:07.172
Huh? Sponsoring?

16
01:08.423 --> 01:09.841
-Well… -Director.

17
01:09.924 --> 01:12.886
I heard Ji Eun-ho got cast in Bo-bae's drama.

18
01:12.969 --> 01:14.512
What are you talking about?

19
01:14.596 --> 01:17.599
Ji Eun-ho's been cast in the drama Ms. Na and I are working on?

20
01:18.433 --> 01:21.519
She must've told you what she was hoping for.

21
01:22.103 --> 01:22.937
Was that it?

22
01:24.105 --> 01:26.858
Oh dear. I must've misunderstood.

23
01:27.942 --> 01:30.278
Bo-bae, you told me the other day.

24
01:30.361 --> 01:33.781
That the director was raving about your script,

25
01:33.865 --> 01:35.992
and Ji Eun-ho had the male lead.

26
01:39.037 --> 01:42.207
I see. She said I was raving?

27
01:42.290 --> 01:44.500
Yeah, I sure was.

28
01:44.584 --> 01:46.252
Raving, all right.

29
01:46.336 --> 01:49.005
But really, Ms. Na's scripts are much better these days.

30
01:49.088 --> 01:51.132
Yeah, they're really great.

31
01:51.216 --> 01:52.050
Well…

32
01:53.051 --> 01:54.385
I'm sorry.

33
01:54.469 --> 01:57.972
I tend to get carried away when I talk.

34
01:58.056 --> 02:00.266
No, it's fine. I get it.

35
02:00.350 --> 02:01.809
You need a little swagger.

36
02:01.893 --> 02:04.687
Otherwise, you can't hold your own in this industry.

37
02:04.771 --> 02:05.605
It's fine.

38
02:05.688 --> 02:06.898
What?

39
02:07.398 --> 02:09.108
Did you lie to me?

40
02:13.529 --> 02:17.408
Mr. Baek, that's what we writers do.

41
02:17.492 --> 02:20.036
We basically make things up.

42
02:21.037 --> 02:22.914
Don't believe everything Bo-bae says.

43
02:25.250 --> 02:29.254
Doesn't that make Ms. Na all the more impressive?

44
02:30.755 --> 02:31.923
Because I fell

45
02:32.966 --> 02:34.384
for her story.

46
02:43.351 --> 02:44.185
Ms. Na.

47
02:46.062 --> 02:49.274
Shall we take a look at the resort's penthouse first?

48
03:44.829 --> 03:46.414
Pull yourself together.

49
03:46.497 --> 03:48.541
Okay.

50
03:48.624 --> 03:51.919
Why listen to someone who's clearly just trying to get under your skin?

51
03:52.003 --> 03:53.713
I mean, I…

52
03:54.630 --> 03:56.966
I guess I did talk things up a little.

53
03:57.050 --> 03:58.760
It was more than just a little.

54
03:58.843 --> 04:01.137
You went way overboard.

55
04:04.682 --> 04:06.017
Mr. Baek.

56
04:06.100 --> 04:07.101
Oh.

57
04:09.103 --> 04:10.938
I was just leaving a TS ad meeting.

58
04:11.773 --> 04:13.191
I didn't expect to see you.

59
04:13.274 --> 04:14.150
Right.

60
04:14.942 --> 04:17.028
I haven't seen you since my birthday.

61
04:17.111 --> 04:19.989
I bet a lot of people have been asking you about us.

62
04:20.073 --> 04:23.910
After the article, people around me thought we already set a wedding date.

63
04:23.993 --> 04:25.536
Actually,

64
04:25.620 --> 04:28.081
I'd like a word with you about that.

65
04:28.164 --> 04:30.208
-I don't think we've met. -Sorry?

66
04:30.792 --> 04:33.002
Right. I'm his secretary.

67
04:33.086 --> 04:34.337
My name is Na Bo-bae.

68
04:35.254 --> 04:36.464
So you're his secretary.

69
04:37.799 --> 04:39.550
Han Seol-hee, director of Hanlim.

70
04:40.134 --> 04:41.135
Right.

71
04:42.637 --> 04:43.471
Yes.

72
04:50.770 --> 04:55.566
Mr. Baek, shouldn't your secretary leave if you want to talk to me?

73
04:56.150 --> 04:59.070
Oh, I'll give you two a moment.

74
05:00.655 --> 05:02.240
I can say it now.

75
05:03.074 --> 05:04.909
Just give me three months.

76
05:05.701 --> 05:07.453
-Three months? -Yes.

77
05:08.037 --> 05:11.916
By then, I'll show what kind of leader I can be for TS.

78
05:12.500 --> 05:16.587
Then my grandmother won't try to force this arranged marriage.

79
05:16.671 --> 05:21.134
You don't want to sacrifice your life for the company either, do you?

80
05:23.594 --> 05:25.430
But I do want to marry you.

81
05:27.807 --> 05:28.808
Sorry?

82
05:30.184 --> 05:32.145
I guess we need to talk some more.

83
05:33.813 --> 05:36.858
Ms. Na, could you grab us some coffee?

84
05:36.941 --> 05:38.192
Decaf for Mr. Baek.

85
05:38.776 --> 05:41.112
Pay with this.

86
05:44.490 --> 05:47.493
I can see we're not on the same page. We can leave it at that.

87
05:48.369 --> 05:49.787
Well, I have to get going.

88
05:49.871 --> 05:53.124
And I really need my secretary with me right now.

89
05:53.207 --> 05:55.918
I didn't hire her just to fetch coffee, after all.

90
05:57.003 --> 05:58.045
I see.

91
05:59.881 --> 06:01.841
I'm sorry, Ms. Na.

92
06:01.924 --> 06:04.760
No, it's okay. I can go get it quickly.

93
06:05.261 --> 06:08.890
I said I need you right now, Ms. Na Bo-bae.

94
06:15.646 --> 06:17.106
Make sure you grab a coffee.

95
06:17.190 --> 06:19.734
Our resort's barista is a former world champion,

96
06:20.318 --> 06:22.111
so the coffee's excellent.

97
06:22.862 --> 06:25.031
I will. See you next time.

98
06:25.615 --> 06:27.158
Sure. See you next time.

99
06:52.225 --> 06:55.520
I could tell right away she's really into you.

100
06:56.020 --> 06:57.605
Why don't you just marry her?

101
06:57.688 --> 07:01.651
She's beautiful, capable, and seems to have a great personality too.

102
07:02.151 --> 07:04.153
You're getting carried away again.

103
07:04.237 --> 07:05.279
What was that?

104
07:07.073 --> 07:08.824
I said I'm not getting married.

105
07:08.908 --> 07:10.409
And I'm not interested in her.

106
07:10.993 --> 07:13.120
You should be thanking me, by the way.

107
07:13.204 --> 07:15.915
I saved you from embarrassing yourself in front of another writer.

108
07:15.998 --> 07:17.583
And I saved you a pointless errand.

109
07:17.667 --> 07:19.585
I never asked you for help.

110
07:19.669 --> 07:22.046
You did it on your own, and now you want credit?

111
07:22.129 --> 07:24.507
Forget it. Just help me with my bucket list.

112
07:24.590 --> 07:26.342
Did you forget our contract?

113
07:26.425 --> 07:28.719
I've been charging you every day, you know.

114
07:28.803 --> 07:31.180
Why are you getting so worked up?

115
07:31.264 --> 07:32.723
I thought you were a chaebol.

116
07:32.807 --> 07:36.602
Yet you get pushed around by your grandma, your cousin, and Director Han.

117
07:36.686 --> 07:39.480
Do you even have any chaebol flex to show me?

118
07:42.275 --> 07:44.068
I'll show you some chaebol flex.

119
07:44.151 --> 07:45.403
What do I have to do?

120
07:49.907 --> 07:52.493
You rented the whole place?

121
07:57.248 --> 07:59.917
But how did you manage to…

122
08:00.001 --> 08:02.503
You asked me to show you some chaebol flex.

123
08:03.588 --> 08:08.634
Anyway, how could you have never been to a theme park? You're almost 30.

124
08:08.718 --> 08:12.430
Why is this even on your romance bucket list?

125
08:13.556 --> 08:17.602
I've been to theme parks before. Just never with a boyfriend.

126
08:18.811 --> 08:19.645
Let's go.

127
08:21.689 --> 08:22.523
Hold on.

128
08:23.024 --> 08:24.275
What is it now?

129
08:24.775 --> 08:27.278
If you're at a theme park, you have to go there.

130
08:34.160 --> 08:35.119
Come here.

131
08:37.496 --> 08:40.541
Wearing one of these headbands is a must at a theme park.

132
08:40.625 --> 08:44.795
What does wearing a headband have to do with the romance in your script?

133
08:44.879 --> 08:48.507
It's the little props that set the mood.

134
08:49.258 --> 08:50.426
Which one should I wear?

135
08:51.427 --> 08:53.471
How about this one? So we match.

136
08:54.555 --> 08:56.599
Hey! The bucket list.

137
09:01.145 --> 09:02.313
How do I look?

138
09:05.358 --> 09:07.652
What? They're so cute!

139
09:07.735 --> 09:09.487
Can we take a picture?

140
09:10.696 --> 09:11.822
Hi!

141
09:13.616 --> 09:16.077
Three, two, one.

142
09:23.459 --> 09:24.960
This is so fun!

143
09:45.064 --> 09:47.358
Hey, put your hands up!

144
09:47.441 --> 09:48.984
Put your hands up!

145
09:53.823 --> 09:56.283
I think I'm going to have a heart attack

146
09:57.076 --> 09:58.786
before we finish your bucket list.

147
09:58.869 --> 10:00.579
I'm so sorry.

148
10:00.663 --> 10:01.497
Are you okay?

149
10:02.748 --> 10:03.791
You're sweating.

150
10:15.928 --> 10:18.222
Are you okay? Shouldn't we go to the hospital?

151
10:18.305 --> 10:19.390
No!

152
10:19.473 --> 10:20.558
Well…

153
10:21.058 --> 10:23.102
You wanted to go to the Haunted House?

154
10:23.769 --> 10:25.521
Let's go to the Haunted House.

155
10:26.105 --> 10:27.648
You're obviously not okay.

156
10:27.732 --> 10:29.900
Your heart rate's over 100.

157
10:39.702 --> 10:41.454
-Let's go in! -No.

158
10:41.537 --> 10:42.747
We can skip this one.

159
10:42.830 --> 10:44.373
You need to watch your heart.

160
10:44.457 --> 10:46.751
I don't think jump scares are good for you.

161
10:46.834 --> 10:49.545
I don't mind skipping it either.

162
10:51.088 --> 10:52.298
No. Let's go.

163
10:52.381 --> 10:53.758
It's on your bucket list.

164
10:55.634 --> 10:56.719
You think

165
10:57.428 --> 10:59.221
this scares me?

166
11:00.473 --> 11:01.724
Wait, Mr. Baek…

167
11:02.850 --> 11:07.146
The ghosts are real people. It won't end well if they touch me.

168
11:14.361 --> 11:15.905
Let's go together.

169
11:18.949 --> 11:21.702
-What's with you? -This is…

170
11:22.870 --> 11:24.288
Damn!

171
11:26.040 --> 11:27.249
Let's go together.

172
11:27.333 --> 11:29.001
-You're scared, aren't you? -No!

173
11:33.756 --> 11:35.841
My back hurts. Hang on.

174
11:39.178 --> 11:41.472
That really startled me.

175
11:41.972 --> 11:44.225
Let's just find the exit and get out of here.

176
11:44.308 --> 11:45.518
Right?

177
11:46.018 --> 11:47.186
I'm totally fine,

178
11:48.062 --> 11:50.481
but if you insist…

179
11:51.857 --> 11:52.817
Come on. Let's go.

180
11:53.651 --> 11:54.777
Let's go together.

181
11:58.989 --> 12:00.324
What? What is it?

182
12:00.407 --> 12:03.202
-It's nothing. -Seriously!

183
12:17.716 --> 12:19.260
Ms. Na!

184
12:19.343 --> 12:21.595
-Run! Now! -Huh?

185
12:21.679 --> 12:23.389
Hey! Where are you going?

186
12:24.181 --> 12:25.933
Mr. Baek! Where are you going?

187
12:27.852 --> 12:28.686
I'm sorry!

188
12:30.104 --> 12:31.897
Mr. Baek! Wait up!

189
12:32.398 --> 12:33.274
I'm sorry!

190
12:33.858 --> 12:34.692
Sorry!

191
12:36.944 --> 12:40.072
Please stop! I'm sorry, everyone!

192
12:50.291 --> 12:53.043
What on earth were you doing in there?

193
12:53.127 --> 12:54.670
How did they end up like that?

194
12:55.754 --> 12:58.674
You've got some nerve saying that after running away without me.

195
12:59.884 --> 13:01.385
I didn't run away.

196
13:01.468 --> 13:03.387
I thought I was holding your hand!

197
13:09.476 --> 13:12.313
Either way, how am I supposed to use this in my script?

198
13:12.396 --> 13:15.774
A male lead ditching the female lead? That's asking for a fight.

199
13:20.195 --> 13:22.323
How's that asking for a fight?

200
13:34.835 --> 13:35.753
Are you upset?

201
13:37.379 --> 13:38.464
Like I said earlier,

202
13:38.547 --> 13:41.926
I didn't mean to leave you behind. It was an accident.

203
13:42.593 --> 13:44.136
No, I'm in a good mood.

204
13:45.471 --> 13:47.014
I'm happy.

205
13:50.351 --> 13:52.478
Actually, going to a theme park

206
13:52.978 --> 13:56.774
was more of a life bucket list item than a romance bucket list one.

207
13:57.358 --> 14:02.696
I went once when I was a little kid. I haven't been in almost 20 years.

208
14:02.780 --> 14:06.367
But today, I got to ride the rides without anyone else around.

209
14:06.450 --> 14:08.619
It was nice hanging out with you.

210
14:10.162 --> 14:12.790
I thought, "This is what theme parks are like."

211
14:12.873 --> 14:14.875
"They're so much fun."

212
14:15.417 --> 14:16.835
"I'm having a blast."

213
14:17.670 --> 14:20.339
Why did you wait so long? You could've just gone.

214
14:22.049 --> 14:22.883
Well,

215
14:24.009 --> 14:24.885
I was just

216
14:25.844 --> 14:28.472
a little scared of theme parks.

217
14:55.749 --> 14:59.545
Anyway, thank you for going to the theme park with me.

218
15:23.152 --> 15:25.946
OLD KINDNESS

219
15:27.906 --> 15:29.450
Hello.

220
15:29.533 --> 15:31.076
Hello.

221
15:32.369 --> 15:35.664
You were looking for a book called Old Kindness, right?

222
15:35.748 --> 15:37.332
You might find it here.

223
15:37.416 --> 15:41.670
That'd be great. It's out of print.

224
15:53.891 --> 15:54.892
It's too…

225
16:20.334 --> 16:22.628
I guess it was pretty dusty up there.

226
16:44.983 --> 16:45.818
Bo-bae.

227
16:47.820 --> 16:48.946
Eun-ho.

228
16:49.029 --> 16:50.489
What are you doing here?

229
16:51.156 --> 16:52.324
What's with the headband?

230
16:54.910 --> 16:57.454
You went to the theme park with Mr. Baek Ho-rang?

231
16:57.538 --> 16:59.832
Yes, we did.

232
16:59.915 --> 17:02.501
It was for research, not for fun.

233
17:02.584 --> 17:06.130
Sorry. I couldn't check my phone because I was on the rides.

234
17:07.381 --> 17:09.758
Huh? What did you want to give me?

235
17:09.842 --> 17:10.801
Yeah.

236
17:12.219 --> 17:13.262
Huh? Right.

237
17:13.846 --> 17:16.348
You said you were stuck on your script and stressed out.

238
17:17.266 --> 17:20.144
This is the book you wanted that was out of print.

239
17:20.644 --> 17:21.728
I found it for you.

240
17:21.812 --> 17:23.063
Really?

241
17:23.897 --> 17:27.234
Eun-ho, you really didn't have to do this.

242
17:27.317 --> 17:29.570
If I don't, who will?

243
17:29.653 --> 17:30.737
Eun-ho.

244
17:33.073 --> 17:34.116
I'm the best, right?

245
17:34.199 --> 17:36.034
Gosh, don't be silly.

246
17:43.792 --> 17:45.878
We meet often these days, Mr. Ji Eun-ho.

247
17:45.961 --> 17:47.045
Indeed.

248
17:47.129 --> 17:50.716
My team called you dozens of times, but you never answer.

249
17:52.009 --> 17:53.510
That has nothing to do with this.

250
17:54.261 --> 17:57.055
I already declined your offer to be the face of your resort.

251
17:58.974 --> 18:00.893
And Bo-bae and I are close.

252
18:02.186 --> 18:04.313
I'm close with Ms. Na Bo-bae too.

253
18:04.396 --> 18:05.397
Come on.

254
18:06.940 --> 18:08.525
Eun-ho, thank you so much.

255
18:08.609 --> 18:09.568
-I'll enjoy it. -Yeah.

256
18:10.152 --> 18:12.362
Call me when you're done. Tell me what you think.

257
18:12.446 --> 18:14.698
-Call me. -Okay. Off you go.

258
18:14.781 --> 18:15.699
I'll get going.

259
18:16.825 --> 18:18.619
Wait. Why are you going that way?

260
18:26.001 --> 18:30.130
It's so dark that I got confused. It's the one over there.

261
18:30.631 --> 18:33.175
Mr. Baek, thank you so much for the ride.

262
18:33.258 --> 18:35.969
I got confused because you parked here.

263
18:36.053 --> 18:38.513
Good night, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

264
18:38.597 --> 18:39.848
What?

265
18:40.891 --> 18:44.895
Thank you so much for helping me with my research today.

266
18:44.978 --> 18:46.063
And thanks, Eun-ho.

267
18:46.146 --> 18:49.316
-Sure. -Go on home, both of you.

268
18:50.442 --> 18:51.610
I'm heading home, then.

269
18:51.693 --> 18:53.695
You're so silly!

270
18:54.446 --> 18:57.241
We only met up for research.

271
18:57.324 --> 18:59.451
Nothing more, nothing less.

272
18:59.952 --> 19:01.954
It's getting late. You should get going.

273
19:02.037 --> 19:02.955
Thank you.

274
19:03.997 --> 19:06.166
-No, but… -Look.

275
19:06.250 --> 19:08.835
Are you seriously going to a woman's house this late?

276
19:08.919 --> 19:09.962
Mr. Baek?

277
19:10.045 --> 19:11.296
He's right.

278
19:11.380 --> 19:13.382
You should go home. To your place.

279
19:20.013 --> 19:21.390
Sure.

280
19:23.475 --> 19:24.393
I'm off.

281
19:25.435 --> 19:26.311
Bye.

282
19:26.395 --> 19:27.562
Thank you, Mr. Baek.

283
19:27.646 --> 19:29.606
Get in your car and go home. Hurry.

284
19:31.900 --> 19:32.943
Thank you!

285
19:44.371 --> 19:47.416
Eun-ho, you should go home too.

286
19:49.751 --> 19:52.045
That's a shame. I wanted to talk a little longer.

287
19:55.924 --> 19:57.801
I've missed you all this time.

288
20:02.514 --> 20:04.141
But I should get going, right?

289
20:07.602 --> 20:09.938
-Let's talk more next time we meet. -Yeah.

290
20:15.235 --> 20:16.069
Hey, punk!

291
20:16.153 --> 20:18.155
You always disappear the second I look away.

292
20:19.239 --> 20:20.866
Hello, Ms. Na.

293
20:21.491 --> 20:24.244
There are many scary people out there these days, you know.

294
20:24.328 --> 20:26.288
If this gets photographed, you're done.

295
20:26.371 --> 20:28.665
Stop giving Hee-chan a hard time and just go.

296
20:29.750 --> 20:30.751
Get in the car.

297
20:30.834 --> 20:32.878
All right, I'm off. I'll call you.

298
20:32.961 --> 20:34.254
What for?

299
20:36.506 --> 20:37.341
I'll call you!

300
20:41.303 --> 20:42.763
-Bye. -Bye!

301
20:45.390 --> 20:47.225
-Bye. -Bye!

302
21:04.910 --> 21:05.994
There you are.

303
21:07.162 --> 21:10.707
Thanks to you, I had to drive around the neighborhood.

304
21:11.208 --> 21:13.585
If he finds out we live together, things could get awkward.

305
21:13.668 --> 21:15.295
Eun-ho might get the wrong idea.

306
21:15.379 --> 21:16.213
Why?

307
21:16.797 --> 21:18.048
Are you worried about him?

308
21:18.799 --> 21:21.843
Technically, we don't live together. We live ten meters apart.

309
21:21.927 --> 21:25.680
It's still awkward. You could say we live under the same roof.

310
21:26.598 --> 21:30.894
Eun-ho is such a sweet kid, I'm sure he'd understand if I explained.

311
21:31.728 --> 21:33.188
Sweet, my ass.

312
21:33.271 --> 21:34.689
What's with you?

313
21:34.773 --> 21:37.401
He is sweet. We've been friends since Wistful Youth.

314
21:37.484 --> 21:39.903
Men and women can never be just friends.

315
21:39.986 --> 21:41.822
And that wistful whatever.

316
21:41.905 --> 21:44.491
You're still going on about it? It's been three years.

317
21:44.991 --> 21:47.119
Every time you two meet, you go on about…

318
21:47.202 --> 21:48.453
What did you say?

319
21:49.538 --> 21:51.164
No, I mean…

320
21:51.248 --> 21:53.792
I know it was your debut and it meant a lot to you.

321
21:53.875 --> 21:54.709
Yeah.

322
21:54.793 --> 21:58.672
I've been floundering for three years. That show means a lot to me.

323
21:59.548 --> 22:00.799
To you,

324
22:00.882 --> 22:05.470
it may be just another one-hour drama no one knows about,

325
22:05.554 --> 22:07.597
but it means the world to me.

326
22:14.563 --> 22:15.856
I remember it too!

327
22:17.357 --> 22:18.817
Wistful Youth.

328
22:27.033 --> 22:28.702
Why is it such a big deal?

329
22:37.002 --> 22:38.712
You're a superstar.

330
22:38.795 --> 22:40.881
You should be careful with everything you do.

331
22:40.964 --> 22:42.591
These days, everyone's a reporter.

332
22:42.674 --> 22:45.010
Everyone has a phone. What if someone snaps a photo?

333
22:45.510 --> 22:47.429
I'm sick of repeating myself.

334
22:47.512 --> 22:48.346
Hee-chan.

335
22:49.806 --> 22:51.183
Should I just do the ad?

336
22:51.266 --> 22:52.392
What? Really?

337
22:52.976 --> 22:55.020
-Watch the road. You're going to crash. -Okay.

338
22:55.896 --> 22:58.648
What made you come up with such a thoughtful idea?

339
22:58.732 --> 23:01.818
Bo-bae and Mr. Baek Ho-rang keep seeing each other

340
23:01.902 --> 23:03.403
because of work.

341
23:03.487 --> 23:06.323
Huh? Ms. Na is seeing Mr. Baek?

342
23:08.533 --> 23:10.243
If work brings us together again,

343
23:11.453 --> 23:13.622
we'll see each other more often, right?

344
23:13.705 --> 23:16.374
It'd be great if you got to see the client more often.

345
23:16.958 --> 23:19.336
Man, Eun-ho has finally moved past his artsy phase--

346
23:19.419 --> 23:20.462
Excuse me?

347
23:20.545 --> 23:23.798
I mean, you've changed your mind. That's great.

348
23:35.018 --> 23:36.603
What made you call me first?

349
23:36.686 --> 23:37.687
Hey.

350
23:38.480 --> 23:40.273
I just wanted to see you.

351
23:40.815 --> 23:43.568
Did something bad happen to my dear Seol-hee?

352
23:43.652 --> 23:45.362
Want me to entertain you a little?

353
23:46.154 --> 23:48.657
Do I look upset? Actually, something good happened.

354
23:50.116 --> 23:51.076
Like what?

355
23:53.161 --> 23:56.206
I ran into Mr. Baek today, and we had a little chat.

356
23:56.289 --> 23:57.123
Baek Ho-rang?

357
23:57.832 --> 23:58.667
Yeah.

358
23:59.417 --> 24:02.212
I knew he was kind,

359
24:02.712 --> 24:04.881
but he really looks after his staff,

360
24:04.965 --> 24:06.758
including his secretary.

361
24:07.551 --> 24:08.927
So that's why?

362
24:09.678 --> 24:11.930
The reason you're throwing such a classy fit.

363
24:22.732 --> 24:24.192
You're right.

364
24:24.859 --> 24:27.529
Na Bo-bae. It was the secretary.

365
24:29.030 --> 24:31.283
The woman I saw at Baek Ho-rang's house.

366
24:34.703 --> 24:35.829
I see.

367
24:35.912 --> 24:38.707
He lives with another woman. He doesn't even care about you.

368
24:38.790 --> 24:40.834
Why the hell are you still hung up on him?

369
24:50.176 --> 24:55.015
Baek Ho-rang is the only man worthy of being my family.

370
25:07.736 --> 25:10.572
Kid! You can't run out like that! You could've been killed.

371
25:10.655 --> 25:13.325
Why did you stop? Just run me over!

372
25:14.159 --> 25:17.245
Sir, I'm sorry. That girl won't move.

373
25:18.413 --> 25:19.247
Kid!

374
25:19.831 --> 25:20.832
Get lost.

375
25:29.549 --> 25:30.425
Think.

376
25:30.508 --> 25:33.595
Think of every way to protect yourself.

377
25:34.554 --> 25:36.931
Do your best to protect yourself.

378
25:37.015 --> 25:39.476
It's better than dying.

379
25:42.687 --> 25:47.567
I'm talking to you! Where are you going? Han Seol-hee! Get back here!

380
26:07.629 --> 26:12.092
The best way to protect myself…

381
26:20.016 --> 26:24.020
Mr. Baek changed my life.

382
26:24.104 --> 26:25.897
What does he know about your life?

383
26:25.980 --> 26:27.148
I know more than he does.

384
26:28.066 --> 26:31.152
I know you're all twisted up inside.

385
26:32.195 --> 26:33.196
And so…

386
26:38.576 --> 26:39.994
So…

387
26:41.913 --> 26:42.914
Just

388
26:44.541 --> 26:45.750
come to me.

389
26:49.379 --> 26:50.296
Do-yoon.

390
26:51.297 --> 26:53.466
Two twisted people shouldn't be together.

391
27:02.892 --> 27:06.146
These will make the front pages of the major newspapers next week.

392
27:06.813 --> 27:08.648
TS HOTEL CAUGHT EMBEZZLING 8 BILLION WON

393
27:09.190 --> 27:11.776
TS HOTEL EXECS PROBED OVER 8-BILLION-WON EMBEZZLEMENT

394
27:14.237 --> 27:16.781
I guess they can use that photo of Choi Do-yoon.

395
27:16.865 --> 27:19.534
The one of him drunk and swearing. He looked good in it.

396
27:19.617 --> 27:21.745
Yes, sir. I'll let them know.

397
27:22.871 --> 27:24.080
We have to end it now.

398
27:25.874 --> 27:28.752
So that family can't get in my way anymore.

399
27:29.252 --> 27:30.086
Yes, sir.

400
27:30.170 --> 27:32.922
What about the new face of our resort? Still not finalized?

401
27:34.048 --> 27:35.133
I'm sorry, sir.

402
27:40.805 --> 27:41.681
Yes?

403
27:45.393 --> 27:48.563
Sir, Ji Eun-ho's agency called.

404
27:48.646 --> 27:51.107
They said he'll do the ad.

405
27:51.191 --> 27:52.025
Just like that?

406
27:52.108 --> 27:54.611
Yes. He'll be here in person soon.

407
27:54.694 --> 27:56.905
-Ji Eun-ho is coming here now? -Yes.

408
27:56.988 --> 27:59.365
No way! I have to get a photo with him.

409
27:59.449 --> 28:01.534
No photos, Mr. Lee.

410
28:01.618 --> 28:03.495
Get a hold of yourself.

411
28:04.287 --> 28:07.665
Either way, this is great news for us!

412
28:07.749 --> 28:09.167
Well done, team.

413
28:09.250 --> 28:11.503
-High five! -Yeah!

414
28:11.586 --> 28:13.171
-We did it! -You too. High five!

415
28:14.464 --> 28:15.840
Well, I…

416
28:16.466 --> 28:18.384
I'm sorry. I got an urgent call.

417
28:18.468 --> 28:20.553
Yay!

418
28:22.722 --> 28:26.059
Bo-bae, do you want to try writing a script?

419
28:26.142 --> 28:27.352
A short one.

420
28:29.270 --> 28:33.983
Actually, there's a director and writer my actor wants to work with.

421
28:34.067 --> 28:36.736
Could we make working with them part of the contract?

422
28:37.904 --> 28:41.157
He wants to choose the director and writer?

423
28:41.241 --> 28:42.617
Could we do that?

424
28:43.326 --> 28:47.163
We'd have to sign the director and writer too.

425
28:47.247 --> 28:48.623
We can't just bring in anyone.

426
28:48.706 --> 28:50.875
You probably know the director.

427
28:50.959 --> 28:53.002
Director Yeom Min-kyu. He directs dramas.

428
28:53.086 --> 28:54.671
Oh, Director Yeom.

429
28:55.171 --> 28:57.549
Well, he's well-known.

430
28:58.132 --> 28:59.217
And the writer?

431
28:59.300 --> 29:01.594
As for the writer…

432
29:02.554 --> 29:04.681
Mr. Baek would know better.

433
29:08.101 --> 29:09.018
Mr. Ji.

434
29:10.270 --> 29:13.398
Is this the reason you wanted to sign the contract?

435
29:13.481 --> 29:14.357
Yes.

436
29:14.440 --> 29:16.985
Does the reason matter, as long as we sign the contract?

437
29:18.987 --> 29:19.904
Mr. Baek.

438
29:20.405 --> 29:23.908
Is there some rule against signing a contract

439
29:24.409 --> 29:25.451
for personal reasons?

440
29:33.167 --> 29:35.503
No. It's fine. Let's sign the contract.

441
29:35.587 --> 29:37.839
You, the director,

442
29:38.339 --> 29:39.549
and the writer.

443
29:39.632 --> 29:40.633
All three of you.

444
29:41.467 --> 29:42.760
Thank you.

445
29:45.513 --> 29:47.098
I look forward to it.

446
29:51.603 --> 29:53.980
I look forward to working with you.

447
30:12.624 --> 30:13.958
Why did you ask for me?

448
30:16.669 --> 30:17.837
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

449
30:19.714 --> 30:20.798
By any chance,

450
30:22.175 --> 30:25.053
did you ask Mr. Ji Eun-ho to let you write the script?

451
30:25.637 --> 30:26.638
What?

452
30:26.721 --> 30:29.307
Mr. Ji said he'd do the ad

453
30:29.390 --> 30:32.936
on the condition that you and Director Yeom work on it.

454
30:36.314 --> 30:38.983
Director Yeom is just an excuse.

455
30:39.067 --> 30:41.819
It's obvious he just wants to work with you.

456
30:42.695 --> 30:45.782
Are you asking me if I used Eun-ho?

457
30:46.866 --> 30:47.700
Well…

458
30:49.118 --> 30:51.788
I did bring up Wistful Youth

459
30:52.288 --> 30:53.831
and said some harsh things last night…

460
30:54.749 --> 30:58.294
You two seem pretty close. And you're running out of time.

461
30:58.378 --> 31:01.130
Your contract's up in two months.

462
31:01.631 --> 31:05.093
Wouldn't it be good for you to have one more chance

463
31:05.176 --> 31:07.637
to show Director Yeom what you can do?

464
31:09.806 --> 31:11.557
Look, Mr. Baek Ho-rang.

465
31:12.100 --> 31:13.267
Sure.

466
31:13.351 --> 31:16.229
Maybe Eun-ho agreed to do the commercial because of me.

467
31:16.312 --> 31:17.230
But you know,

468
31:17.814 --> 31:20.441
some people help and rely on each other out of goodwill

469
31:20.525 --> 31:23.277
instead of using each other as tools.

470
31:23.361 --> 31:25.613
That's something you'll never understand.

471
31:28.157 --> 31:32.203
And I'd appreciate it if you didn't summon me like this again.

472
31:32.286 --> 31:34.956
I mean, you have a fiancée.

473
31:35.039 --> 31:37.125
We don't want her getting the wrong idea.

474
31:37.208 --> 31:38.835
I told you I'm not getting married.

475
31:38.918 --> 31:40.628
-And about charging-- -Charging!

476
31:41.963 --> 31:44.882
We can charge just fine within ten meters.

477
31:54.517 --> 31:56.019
Why is she getting angry?

478
32:10.825 --> 32:13.745
You think Ms. Na and Mr. Baek are dating?

479
32:13.828 --> 32:15.538
They were arguing.

480
32:15.621 --> 32:18.332
She was even scolding Mr. Baek.

481
32:18.416 --> 32:19.584
No way!

482
32:19.667 --> 32:21.085
Seriously? That's crazy.

483
32:21.169 --> 32:23.379
Why else would a secretary scold a senior managing director?

484
32:23.463 --> 32:25.506
They must be dating.

485
32:25.590 --> 32:28.134
-Gosh. That's a dead giveaway. -Yeah, 100%.

486
32:28.217 --> 32:31.137
I'm telling you. I heard them just as I was about to knock.

487
32:31.220 --> 32:32.055
-Oh my! -My gosh!

488
32:32.138 --> 32:34.098
-So I stopped and listened. -For real?

489
32:34.182 --> 32:35.224
This is insane.

490
32:35.308 --> 32:36.601
-I know, right? -My gosh.

491
32:44.192 --> 32:45.651
This is the Executive Office.

492
32:45.735 --> 32:49.197
You know the list of premium brand contacts we asked for?

493
32:49.280 --> 32:52.241
Please send it over right away so we can…

494
33:01.417 --> 33:05.046
Actually, I saw something the other day too.

495
33:11.094 --> 33:13.012
WHAT ARE YOU UP TO, SEOL-HEE?

496
33:16.641 --> 33:18.101
Father!

497
33:18.935 --> 33:22.063
You nearly split your only son's head open with that.

498
33:22.814 --> 33:26.984
Did you know Baek Ho-rang is preparing to expose the embezzlement at TS Hotel?

499
33:27.485 --> 33:30.363
-Sorry? -I bet you had no idea.

500
33:30.446 --> 33:34.951
Stop making yourself look dumber than him.

501
33:39.705 --> 33:40.957
TS HOTEL CAUGHT EMBEZZLING 8 BILLION WON

502
33:41.040 --> 33:43.126
If Reporter Park hadn't told me,

503
33:43.209 --> 33:45.920
that article would've run next week.

504
33:49.632 --> 33:52.301
If they find out what we did,

505
33:52.885 --> 33:55.096
your mother, you,

506
33:55.179 --> 33:56.305
and I

507
33:56.973 --> 33:58.474
are all done for.

508
34:04.147 --> 34:05.773
What was his name again?

509
34:06.566 --> 34:07.650
Your hotel's VP.

510
34:08.818 --> 34:10.278
It's Yoon Dong-seok.

511
34:10.361 --> 34:14.073
Yeah. Cut him loose. Make sure it doesn't lead back to us.

512
34:16.284 --> 34:17.410
Better yet,

513
34:18.619 --> 34:21.247
just tie Baek Ho-rang to it and get rid of them both.

514
34:21.998 --> 34:24.167
Fake a ledger or something.

515
34:24.250 --> 34:26.586
Make it look like Baek Ho-rang had Yoon Dong-seok

516
34:26.669 --> 34:28.129
set up his own aunt and cousin.

517
34:28.212 --> 34:30.006
Something along those lines.

518
34:42.268 --> 34:46.063
Mr. Baek, this is Yoon Dong-seok, the VP of TS Hotel.

519
34:52.403 --> 34:55.031
Thank you for making time for me, sir.

520
34:55.615 --> 34:56.449
First,

521
34:57.158 --> 34:58.117
let's have a drink.

522
34:59.118 --> 35:00.453
It's a bit early for alcohol.

523
35:02.538 --> 35:04.457
What did you want to talk to me about?

524
35:05.499 --> 35:07.001
Well…

525
35:51.254 --> 35:52.255
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

526
35:53.631 --> 35:55.216
Ms. Na. Over here.

527
36:08.187 --> 36:09.355
Thank you.

528
36:17.196 --> 36:20.908
You all remember what our new model, Ji Eun-ho, asked for, right?

529
36:20.992 --> 36:24.161
Yes. He wanted to choose the director and writer.

530
36:30.251 --> 36:34.922
Ms. Na Bo-bae over there is the writer.

531
36:36.257 --> 36:38.301
Hello, I'm Na Bo-bae.

532
36:38.384 --> 36:41.387
I used to be a drama writer.

533
36:41.470 --> 36:42.471
And now,

534
36:42.555 --> 36:45.641
as you know, I'm Mr. Baek Ho-rang's secretary.

535
36:45.725 --> 36:48.978
Why would a drama writer become a secretary?

536
36:49.895 --> 36:50.938
That's…

537
36:51.731 --> 36:52.898
Well…

538
37:00.197 --> 37:01.949
I was struggling financially.

539
37:04.535 --> 37:06.662
You see, as a drama writer,

540
37:06.746 --> 37:10.416
you don't get paid for your script until the drama airs.

541
37:12.835 --> 37:13.961
Oh dear.

542
37:16.464 --> 37:19.925
I was starving to death, with all my hopes and dreams gone.

543
37:21.469 --> 37:24.722
Then Mr. Baek Ho-rang offered me a job as his secretary.

544
37:24.805 --> 37:27.516
So now I use my writing skills as his secretary.

545
37:28.142 --> 37:34.065
Ms. Na has already worked with Mr. Ji Eun-ho as writer and actor.

546
37:34.148 --> 37:36.025
She'll be a great help.

547
37:36.525 --> 37:39.820
She'll continue as my secretary,

548
37:39.904 --> 37:43.657
but for this project, treat her as a writer.

549
37:45.701 --> 37:47.870
-Looking forward to working with you. -Likewise.

550
37:48.371 --> 37:49.330
No wonder.

551
37:49.830 --> 37:52.833
The name was so unusual. I thought it was someone by the same name.

552
37:53.542 --> 37:55.169
But it was you.

553
37:55.252 --> 37:57.088
Looking forward to working with you.

554
37:57.171 --> 37:59.215
I look forward to working with you too.

555
38:00.216 --> 38:04.303
Now, let's take a look at the concepts you prepared.

556
38:04.929 --> 38:09.350
The key to the first concept is the joy of eating.

557
38:09.433 --> 38:11.143
It's a gourmet-focused concept.

558
38:11.727 --> 38:14.230
It's not just about eating at the resort.

559
38:14.313 --> 38:16.107
It becomes the reason for the trip.

560
38:16.190 --> 38:17.441
Next.

561
38:17.525 --> 38:18.984
Gourmet food is important,

562
38:19.068 --> 38:21.278
but what comes to mind when you think of "rest"?

563
38:21.362 --> 38:24.448
It's literally about resting and doing nothing.

564
38:24.532 --> 38:25.574
Next.

565
38:25.658 --> 38:28.661
Next, we focused on the model, Ji Eun-ho.

566
38:28.744 --> 38:34.458
We thought the space where Ji Eun-ho rests could become the resort's identity.

567
38:34.542 --> 38:36.043
That's all.

568
38:44.260 --> 38:47.012
Are these three concepts all you have?

569
38:47.096 --> 38:49.473
Yes. We were short on time.

570
38:49.557 --> 38:52.059
I see. Thank you all for your hard work.

571
38:53.185 --> 38:54.311
First,

572
38:55.312 --> 38:57.690
I think I should give you more time.

573
38:57.773 --> 39:00.443
Yes. Just give us one more week, and we can--

574
39:00.526 --> 39:01.610
One day.

575
39:01.694 --> 39:02.695
Pardon?

576
39:05.698 --> 39:07.283
One day.

577
39:08.784 --> 39:14.290
Plan A was for Ms. Na to turn today's meeting ideas

578
39:14.373 --> 39:16.542
into a one-minute drama.

579
39:16.625 --> 39:19.879
But since no one seems to have any good ideas,

580
39:19.962 --> 39:21.380
we'll go with Plan B.

581
39:21.881 --> 39:24.508
We'll figure something out, even if it takes all night.

582
39:25.384 --> 39:26.594
"All night"?

583
39:28.137 --> 39:30.014
Yes. Of course!

584
39:30.598 --> 39:32.558
My team loves pulling all-nighters.

585
39:33.851 --> 39:36.353
Glad to hear it. Let's work hard together.

586
39:36.437 --> 39:39.106
Mr. Baek, you're pulling an all-nighter with the team?

587
39:39.190 --> 39:41.942
I figured this would happen, so I cleared my schedule.

588
39:45.571 --> 39:46.572
Oh…

589
39:47.156 --> 39:48.407
You had it all planned out.

590
39:48.491 --> 39:49.742
As expected.

591
39:50.951 --> 39:52.536
Then I'll join you.

592
39:53.162 --> 39:56.123
Looks like we'll need plenty of coffee and energy drinks tonight.

593
39:56.207 --> 39:57.500
-Then I'll-- -Ms. Na.

594
39:58.250 --> 40:00.669
I mean, Ms. Writer, you can head home.

595
40:01.420 --> 40:03.506
Hanlim should take care of this.

596
40:03.589 --> 40:06.717
Your job is to write the script.

597
40:59.061 --> 41:00.104
Ms. Na.

598
41:02.064 --> 41:02.898
Yes?

599
41:08.362 --> 41:10.281
I've been meaning to tell you this.

600
41:10.364 --> 41:14.034
I know you need to stay close to Mr. Baek to charge him,

601
41:14.118 --> 41:16.495
but please be extra careful

602
41:16.579 --> 41:20.082
when Director Han Seol-hee is at the office.

603
41:21.000 --> 41:22.334
Be careful?

604
41:22.418 --> 41:23.627
About what?

605
41:23.711 --> 41:27.214
Didn't you keep staring at Mr. Baek during the meeting?

606
41:27.923 --> 41:31.802
That's because he was running the meeting.

607
41:31.885 --> 41:34.930
And you kept staring at him on your way out.

608
41:35.014 --> 41:35.931
That was…

609
41:40.894 --> 41:41.854
I was glaring at him.

610
41:44.189 --> 41:45.524
In any case,

611
41:45.608 --> 41:50.988
Director Han is publicly known as Mr. Baek's fiancée.

612
41:51.488 --> 41:56.452
So it'd be best not to make it so obvious that you're close to Mr. Baek.

613
41:56.535 --> 41:58.537
I wasn't trying to make it obvious.

614
41:59.371 --> 42:01.457
We're actually close because of the charging.

615
42:01.540 --> 42:04.710
Even so, I'd like you to be more careful.

616
42:04.793 --> 42:08.047
From his secretaries and employees to the staff at his house,

617
42:08.130 --> 42:12.134
there are more eyes and ears around Mr. Baek than you realize.

618
42:13.594 --> 42:16.221
And not all of them are on his side.

619
42:18.807 --> 42:19.642
Well, then.

620
42:26.315 --> 42:28.442
Why's he always picking on me?

621
42:29.860 --> 42:31.737
I should just zap him.

622
42:39.411 --> 42:41.789
Why didn't you tell me you were a writer?

623
42:41.872 --> 42:43.874
I had no idea.

624
42:44.458 --> 42:46.585
Now I can tell you're a writer.

625
42:46.669 --> 42:48.587
I can tell you're smart.

626
42:48.671 --> 42:50.923
What was the drama you did with Ji Eun-ho?

627
42:51.006 --> 42:53.050
It was just a single-episode drama.

628
42:53.133 --> 42:55.052
-I'm a secretary now. -One-episode drama?

629
42:55.135 --> 42:56.679
-That's so cool. -What's going on?

630
42:58.764 --> 43:02.601
If you don't want to pull an all-nighter with Mr. Baek,

631
43:03.143 --> 43:05.479
you'd better focus on your work.

632
43:06.063 --> 43:07.231
-Yes, sir. -Yes, sir.

633
43:07.314 --> 43:08.148
Tell me later.

634
43:09.149 --> 43:10.150
You're so cool.

635
43:22.746 --> 43:24.665
How am I supposed to charge him?

636
43:25.332 --> 43:29.044
He can be away from me for up to 25 hours, so I guess it doesn't matter.

637
43:31.714 --> 43:33.507
Should I find something similar?

638
43:40.222 --> 43:43.767
He'll come to me if he needs me. That's what Mr. Yoon said too.

639
44:08.625 --> 44:09.543
CHOI DO-YOON

640
44:12.546 --> 44:14.757
It's not a bad direction. I like it.

641
44:14.840 --> 44:18.635
Watching Ji Eun-ho act could be part of the fun.

642
44:19.136 --> 44:20.637
Genre…

643
44:20.721 --> 44:22.055
CHOI DO-YOON SENT A PHOTO

644
44:22.139 --> 44:24.349
If there's a story, it'll be more immersive.

645
44:39.406 --> 44:40.449
Hello?

646
44:40.532 --> 44:42.075
What was that photo you just sent?

647
44:42.159 --> 44:44.620
Your secretary seems to be going home by herself today.

648
44:47.372 --> 44:48.457
Choi Do-yoon.

649
44:49.249 --> 44:50.459
Don't do anything stupid.

650
44:50.542 --> 44:52.002
How did you know, Ho-rang?

651
44:52.085 --> 44:54.087
I was just about to do something stupid.

652
44:54.171 --> 44:56.131
Hey, Choi Do-yoon.

653
44:58.634 --> 45:02.095
I was so curious why you keep that woman around

654
45:02.179 --> 45:03.972
that I decided to find out for myself.

655
45:04.723 --> 45:07.059
I heard you were going to be in a meeting all night.

656
45:07.976 --> 45:09.061
Good luck.

657
45:55.148 --> 45:56.525
PORTABLE CHARGER

658
45:57.359 --> 45:58.652
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

659
46:00.445 --> 46:01.780
Where are you right now?

660
46:02.406 --> 46:03.615
Are you okay?

661
46:03.699 --> 46:04.741
Sorry?

662
46:05.325 --> 46:06.702
I'm at the office.

663
46:24.303 --> 46:26.138
What's wrong? You look pale.

664
46:26.221 --> 46:27.973
Earlier, why didn't you…

665
46:29.182 --> 46:30.934
Why didn't you pick up your phone?

666
46:31.018 --> 46:34.479
I was talking to my friend, Seo-jeong.

667
46:34.980 --> 46:37.065
But why do you look like that?

668
46:37.149 --> 46:38.692
What's wrong? Are you sick?

669
46:38.775 --> 46:39.902
No.

670
46:41.653 --> 46:43.572
Never mind. Let's talk somewhere else.

671
46:44.865 --> 46:45.699
But…

672
46:48.994 --> 46:51.371
Why were you looking for me? Is your heart okay?

673
46:51.455 --> 46:53.248
Come on. Tell me.

674
46:53.332 --> 46:56.543
No, it's not about charging…

675
46:57.210 --> 46:58.045
It's…

676
46:58.754 --> 46:59.755
Did anything happen

677
47:00.881 --> 47:02.090
with Choi Do-yoon?

678
47:03.967 --> 47:04.801
Well…

679
47:06.470 --> 47:07.721
Did he try to hurt you?

680
47:07.804 --> 47:09.181
You mean your cousin?

681
47:09.264 --> 47:11.808
I did run into him earlier at the bus stop.

682
47:13.060 --> 47:15.604
Hey, Ms. Na Bo-bae. It's been a while.

683
47:20.692 --> 47:23.070
You're Mr. Baek Ho-rang's cousin.

684
47:23.862 --> 47:25.572
Are you going home? Want a ride?

685
47:25.656 --> 47:26.907
No, thanks.

686
47:28.367 --> 47:30.243
I like girls who play hard to get.

687
47:42.673 --> 47:44.007
Do you want to grab a drink?

688
47:45.676 --> 47:47.552
We can have a deep conversation.

689
47:53.600 --> 47:54.601
Hello?

690
47:55.185 --> 47:56.269
Hey, Seo-jeong.

691
47:57.729 --> 47:59.731
Really? You're coming to the resort?

692
48:00.357 --> 48:03.026
Yeah. Call me after you drop Director Yeom off.

693
48:03.527 --> 48:04.361
All right.

694
48:09.116 --> 48:13.578
I just made plans with someone else, so I can't drink with you.

695
48:14.079 --> 48:17.791
Honestly, I don't even want a shallow conversation with you.

696
48:18.375 --> 48:19.793
That's a shame.

697
48:19.876 --> 48:21.336
Not for me.

698
48:22.671 --> 48:24.381
Get going. Yeah.

699
48:32.305 --> 48:33.181
That stings!

700
48:34.474 --> 48:35.308
What was that?

701
48:38.145 --> 48:39.104
Bye!

702
48:49.990 --> 48:51.658
She's kind of cute, huh?

703
48:52.659 --> 48:54.119
Damn.

704
48:57.372 --> 48:58.373
What?

705
48:59.332 --> 49:00.250
What's wrong with this car?

706
49:02.252 --> 49:03.754
Damn it.

707
49:03.837 --> 49:05.881
Was that really all?

708
49:05.964 --> 49:08.467
Yeah. Then I came back to the office to meet my friend.

709
49:12.596 --> 49:13.805
Your friend? Which one?

710
49:13.889 --> 49:14.931
Why do you ask?

711
49:15.015 --> 49:17.768
Do you think I'd meet Eun-ho and plot behind your back?

712
49:18.602 --> 49:22.773
Who I meet is none of your business. If you don't need charging, I'm leaving.

713
49:29.780 --> 49:30.655
What are you doing?

714
49:35.452 --> 49:37.621
Let go! You'll rip my clothes!

715
49:39.831 --> 49:41.500
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

716
49:42.584 --> 49:45.087
Can't you cancel your plans for today?

717
49:46.129 --> 49:46.963
Huh?

718
49:47.714 --> 49:49.424
I'm just worried!

719
49:49.966 --> 49:51.051
About my health!

720
49:51.134 --> 49:54.930
I'm not feeling well, and my battery's running low!

721
49:55.013 --> 49:57.349
What? So you're not feeling well.

722
49:57.432 --> 49:59.392
You need a supercharge right now, don't you?

723
49:59.476 --> 50:02.437
No, I don't need a supercharge.

724
50:05.273 --> 50:06.525
Can't you just

725
50:07.109 --> 50:09.861
stay with me during my meeting?

726
50:09.945 --> 50:12.531
You said you didn't need me during your meeting.

727
50:14.407 --> 50:15.867
Just be honest with me.

728
50:16.451 --> 50:17.702
Are you sick?

729
50:21.081 --> 50:23.583
I feel sick, but maybe I don't.

730
50:26.002 --> 50:27.587
Let's charge you first.

731
50:27.671 --> 50:29.297
There's no one else here now.

732
50:30.465 --> 50:31.675
You can talk now.

733
50:34.094 --> 50:35.011
Yes.

734
50:35.095 --> 50:36.179
Hold on a second.

735
50:40.350 --> 50:41.977
That's Mr. Yoon, isn't it?

736
50:42.060 --> 50:43.270
Yes.

737
50:43.854 --> 50:45.230
I think it's him.

738
50:45.313 --> 50:46.690
I think he's on the phone.

739
50:52.279 --> 50:53.530
Damn it.

740
50:53.613 --> 50:56.825
If he finds out I'm with you, he'll give me an earful again.

741
50:59.786 --> 51:00.704
Follow me.

742
51:15.635 --> 51:17.470
I don't think anyone's here.

743
51:17.554 --> 51:19.973
Come on. Let's charge you before anyone shows up.

744
51:20.765 --> 51:23.059
Hey, wait a second.

745
51:24.477 --> 51:26.730
I didn't ask you to stay to charge me.

746
51:27.314 --> 51:28.690
Actually…

747
51:30.984 --> 51:32.694
Choi Do-yoon threatened me.

748
51:32.777 --> 51:35.113
He said he'd do something to you.

749
51:36.156 --> 51:37.741
I was worried about that.

750
51:38.617 --> 51:39.576
Threatened you?

751
51:43.038 --> 51:44.706
But he didn't do anything to me.

752
51:44.789 --> 51:46.291
We talked for maybe a minute.

753
51:46.875 --> 51:48.376
Well, you never know.

754
51:48.460 --> 51:52.714
Do-yoon has always been determined to find my weaknesses.

755
51:55.133 --> 51:57.636
But he can't do anything to me.

756
51:57.719 --> 51:59.679
What? How can you be so sure?

757
52:01.431 --> 52:02.265
Well…

758
52:04.100 --> 52:06.686
If he touches me, he'll end up like a rotisserie chicken.

759
52:07.437 --> 52:09.773
I told you my brother and sister were athletes.

760
52:09.856 --> 52:11.900
I learned some self-defense.

761
52:11.983 --> 52:14.444
I've never lost a fight with anyone.

762
52:14.527 --> 52:15.820
Don't worry.

763
52:16.863 --> 52:20.283
Gosh, you worry too much.

764
52:20.909 --> 52:23.286
Come on. I'll fully charge you before I go.

765
52:26.331 --> 52:27.165
Oh man.

766
52:44.683 --> 52:45.725
Girlfriend?

767
52:46.434 --> 52:48.061
Isn't that Director Han Seol-hee?

768
52:48.561 --> 52:49.688
They're in the meeting.

769
52:50.188 --> 52:53.024
I heard from the secretaries

770
52:53.108 --> 52:56.111
that Mr. Baek was dating our project writer.

771
52:56.194 --> 52:57.904
You know, the secretary.

772
52:57.988 --> 52:59.114
What?

773
52:59.698 --> 53:04.744
They didn't even start dating until after the wedding announcement.

774
53:05.412 --> 53:06.746
Isn't that practically an affair?

775
53:06.830 --> 53:09.040
-Of course it is. -Is that what it is?

776
53:09.624 --> 53:11.376
-Yes. -I didn't think he was like that.

777
53:19.092 --> 53:20.719
Director Han. Hello.

778
53:20.802 --> 53:22.345
-Hello, sir. You made it. -Yes.

779
53:22.429 --> 53:24.222
Sorry for calling you so late. We're short on time.

780
53:24.306 --> 53:26.308
Pulling an all-nighter is nothing in showbiz.

781
53:26.391 --> 53:27.475
Where's Ho-rang?

782
53:27.559 --> 53:28.852
He called his senior here.

783
53:28.935 --> 53:31.354
He should be the one coming out to greet me, right?

784
53:31.438 --> 53:33.732
-One moment. I'll give him a call. -Sure.

785
53:34.816 --> 53:36.026
-This way. -Sure.

786
53:51.541 --> 53:52.584
That startled me.

787
53:55.503 --> 53:56.838
DIRECTOR HAN SEOL-HEE

788
53:56.921 --> 53:59.674
Didn't you just hear a phone vibrating in here?

789
54:01.176 --> 54:03.636
If we get caught here, it'll look suspicious.

790
54:03.720 --> 54:05.180
-What now? -Huh?

791
54:05.263 --> 54:06.514
Is he in here?

792
54:08.016 --> 54:08.850
Ho-rang.

793
54:08.933 --> 54:09.768
Shoot.

794
54:17.108 --> 54:19.319
-Come here! Hurry! -What are you doing there?

795
54:19.402 --> 54:20.820
Come on, hurry!

796
54:29.496 --> 54:30.747
Get in here, quick!

797
54:33.291 --> 54:34.334
Oh man.

798
54:34.417 --> 54:35.418
Ho-rang?

799
54:37.379 --> 54:38.421
Ho-rang.

800
54:40.382 --> 54:41.466
The door's locked.

801
54:43.301 --> 54:45.845
You can only lock this door from the inside.

802
54:46.638 --> 54:48.264
That means he's inside right now.

803
54:49.391 --> 54:50.433
You sleeping in there?

804
54:51.684 --> 54:54.187
You called me here, and you're sleeping in there?

805
54:54.854 --> 54:55.897
Hey, wake up.

806
54:56.689 --> 54:57.524
Ho-rang!

807
54:58.525 --> 55:00.944
Wake up, or I break the door down. That's my Plan B.

808
55:01.027 --> 55:02.404
Wake up before that happens.

809
55:03.738 --> 55:04.572
All right?

810
55:08.993 --> 55:10.161
Turn it off.

811
55:10.245 --> 55:11.329
-Turn it off. -Okay.

812
55:11.830 --> 55:14.249
I think I heard something.

813
55:14.874 --> 55:16.418
-You heard that too, right? -Yes.

814
55:16.501 --> 55:17.710
You did, right?

815
55:20.797 --> 55:21.756
Ho-rang.

816
55:22.549 --> 55:23.383
Director Yeom?

817
55:24.300 --> 55:26.386
-Director Han. -You're Mr. Baek's secretary.

818
55:26.469 --> 55:29.264
I think Mr. Baek's in there. Could you roar like a tiger?

819
55:29.889 --> 55:30.723
Excuse me?

820
55:31.433 --> 55:32.267
Just kidding.

821
55:32.350 --> 55:33.184
I'll do it.

822
55:33.268 --> 55:35.478
Mr. Yoon, do you have a master key?

823
55:36.312 --> 55:38.606
The master key should be in my desk.

824
55:39.107 --> 55:39.941
Why do you ask?

825
55:43.653 --> 55:44.654
Got it.

826
55:58.710 --> 55:59.711
Quiet.

827
56:24.152 --> 56:25.820
See? Look at that.

828
56:30.992 --> 56:33.411
Mr. Baek. Please give us one more week.

829
56:33.495 --> 56:34.579
It's not him.

830
56:35.205 --> 56:36.206
Who is that?

831
56:38.124 --> 56:39.751
Gosh, he must be really tired.

832
56:39.834 --> 56:40.835
Sir.

833
56:43.963 --> 56:46.341
Tell him to come to the meeting room once he's up.

834
56:49.427 --> 56:50.470
I'm off too.

835
57:21.918 --> 57:23.920
Where is this punk?

836
57:24.003 --> 57:26.506
How dare he keep me waiting? I'm Yeom Min-kyu.

837
57:27.924 --> 57:29.759
He's gone.

838
57:31.803 --> 57:33.805
I thought my heart was going to explode.

839
57:42.480 --> 57:43.773
Ms. Na Bo-bae.

840
57:45.900 --> 57:46.734
Yes?

841
57:48.695 --> 57:49.862
Me too.

842
57:53.157 --> 57:54.367
What do you mean?

843
57:55.577 --> 57:56.703
When I'm

844
57:57.412 --> 57:59.539
with you,

845
58:00.707 --> 58:02.917
I worry about you all the time.

846
58:03.585 --> 58:05.295
My heart's racing so fast…

847
58:09.507 --> 58:11.134
it feels like it will explode.

848
01:00:06.582 --> 01:00:11.212
Subtitle translation by: Sung In Jang
